svg: rgba() colors and @font-face fonts (#6339)

Text filled with rgba() drew black and fonts embedded as WOFF/TTF data
URIs in @font-face rules were ignored, so text drew in Times. Parse
rgba() and its alpha; load @font-face data URI fonts from <style> and
use them for a matching font-family. Text also honors fill-opacity.

